On Tue, 2004-09-21 at 16:05, xorediedi wrote:
> Hello everyone, Im new here. Is here anyone that
> got SoftSDV ?

You are about 5 years too late.  This was only available from Intel
under an NDA, and they stopped distributing it when early hardware
became available.

However, HP is distributing a simulator, along with auxiliary files, so
that you can boot a kernel on the simulator.  See
    http://www.hpl.hp.com/research/linux/ski/


